This is a modified version of youtube-webos, an open-source YouTube client for
LG webOS TVs released under GPL-3.0-only; the original code is copyright its
respective contributors. Modified in 2026: new application identity
(youtube.nextgen), Russian interface, OLED true-black mode, minimal settings
skin, new icons and artwork, previous branding removed. Includes fixes ported
from youtube-webos 0.8.5 beta 2 (see docs/upstream.md).

Third-party code and assets
- src/app_api/index.ts, src/lang-settings-fix.ts and parts of
  src/auto-login.js are adapted from TizenTube by reisxd (GPL-3.0).
- src/speed/ (playback speed engine) comes from the Schmiddisen fork of
  youtube-webos (GPL-3.0).
- src/vendor/dearrow/ is DeArrow's title formatter by Ajay Ramachandran
  (github.com/ajayyy/DeArrow, GPL-3.0); see src/vendor/README.md.
- src/domrect-polyfill.js is from the Financial Times polyfill-library (MIT).
- Bundled npm packages: whatwg-fetch (MIT), @twemoji/api (MIT),
  tiny-sha256 (public domain), @babel/runtime helpers (MIT).
- Emoji graphics are loaded at runtime from Twemoji (CC-BY 4.0) on webOS 4
  and older.

Online services used at runtime: SponsorBlock (sponsorblock.inf.re, with
sponsor.ajay.app as fallback), DeArrow when turned on (sponsor.ajay.app,
dearrow-thumb.ajay.app), Return YouTube Dislike (returnyoutubedislikeapi.com);
on webOS 4 and older also Google Fonts and Twemoji images
(cdnjs.cloudflare.com).

